<title>USA: Berklee College, Mass., repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Berklee College, Mass., repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Tuesday it repriced and restructured Massachusetts Health and Educational Facilities Authority's $40 million bond deal for Berklee College of Music, lowering yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
